    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0473" n="215" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg215"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/1116</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Van Dyke</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1915</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 3.20 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>266. Oversea Trust arrangement in my 257, 30th, now limited to goods in Holland
                    before May 15, and shipped from Holland before June 1. This applies also to
                    Belgian goods.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Van Dyke</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
